  "title": "Baked Mexican Chips on a Stick",
  "description": "Spiralized potatoes are threaded onto skewers, seasoned with taco seasoning, and baked into these crisp homemade chips with Mexican flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "lutzflcat"
  ],
